    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For the first time, East Africa welcomed the International Consortium for Education Development (ICED) Conference 2024, held in Nairobi, Kenya, from June 5 to June 7. This landmark event, co-hosted by the Association for Faculty Enrichment in Learning and Teaching (AFELT), convened global educators and academic leaders under the theme \"Advancing Higher Education Ecosystems for Competency Development.\"",
